      "strengths_deep_dive": [
        "TCF-USA demonstrates a robust commitment to financial health and transparency. The charity maintains <cite id=\"10\">4.7 months of working capital</cite>, providing a strong buffer for its large-scale operations in Pakistan. Its fundraising is remarkably lean, spending only <cite id=\"11\">$0.09 to raise every $1</cite> in revenue. This efficiency is paired with strong governance, featuring a <cite id=\"12\">15-member board with 100% independent members</cite>. Furthermore, the organization tracks <cite id=\"13\">four distinct outcome metrics</cite> through Candid, ensuring that its growth is backed by measurable student success and community impact."
      ],
      "summary": "The Citizens Foundation USA (TCF-USA) is a premier educational nonprofit that has been <cite id=\"1\">operating since 1995</cite> to provide high-quality schooling to underprivileged children in Pakistan. The organization supports a massive network of schools designed to remove barriers of class and privilege, serving <cite id=\"2\">approximately 320,000 beneficiaries</cite>. In FY2024, the charity managed <cite id=\"3\">$21,703,144 in total revenue</cite>, demonstrating a stable <cite id=\"4\">3-year revenue growth rate of 2.4%</cite>. TCF-USA is highly efficient, maintaining a <cite id=\"5\">89.5% program expense ratio</cite> according to its latest financial filings, which ensures that nearly every dollar donated goes directly toward educational services. The charity holds an <cite id=\"6\">overall score of 99.3/100 from Charity Navigator</cite>, reflecting top-tier accountability and leadership. For Muslim donors, the organization is <cite id=\"7\">verified as Zakat-eligible</cite>, with policies in place to ensure funds support eligible categories such as the poor (fuqara) and needy (masakin). By focusing on direct service delivery, TCF-USA maintains an <cite id=\"8\">exceptional cost-per-beneficiary of $55.37</cite>, making it one of the most cost-effective global education charities in operation today.",
